    english: "Hold \xB7 Return to formation and reduce damage and knockback."
  - uid: UI_BATTLE_COMMAND_PROTECT
    korean: "\uD6C4\uC5F4 \uBCF4\uD638 \xB7 \uC804\uC704\uAC00 \uC6D0\uAC70\uB9AC\xB7\uC9C0\uC6D0
